cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite this repository and the associated
  manuscript. The HEAPO dataset should be cited separately using its original
  publication and data source.

title: "HEAPO Uncertainty Forecasting"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python code accompanying the study
  "Residential Heat-Pump Electricity Forecasting: Generalisation to Unseen
  Households, Interval Calibration and Peak Management". The workflow evaluates
  15-min air-source and ground-source heat-pump electricity demand using
  chronological and household-disjoint testing. It includes persistence and
  seasonal benchmarks, Elastic Net, LightGBM, Temporal Fusion Transformer,
  probabilistic forecasting, conformal interval recalibration, household-level
  bootstrap inference, SHAP-based model interpretation, virtual portfolio
  construction, and forecast-driven peak-management experiments with a
  perfect-foresight diagnostic.

type: software

